{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15045","headline":"大梵山寺院奉呈趣上人赵中丞 · 卢纶","name":"大梵山寺院奉呈趣上人赵中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渐欲休人事，僧房学闭关。\n伴鱼浮水上，看鹤向林间。\n寺古秋仍早，松深暮更闲。\n月中随道友，夜夜坐空山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}